[node name="Convo2" parent="Convo/Panel3" unique_id=2123301580 instance=ExtResource("8_slfo7")]
layout_mode = 0
offset_left = -192.0
offset_top = -196.0
offset_right = 882.0
offset_bottom = 53.0
text = "\"Wait!\" he says. \"Holy shit, man, don't shoot!\" 

You lower the pistol by a few inches. His shoulders are tensed. He could move at any moment. If he darts into an aisle, you won't have a clean shot anymore. The guidebook is clear in this situation. 

\"Hey, man, did you find anything?\" he says, licking his lips. His teeth are crooked and yellow. \"I haven't been able to find food, man. I need something. I have a kid,\" he says, clearly willing to push any luck he has. \"A little girl. Come on, man, did you find anything? We need help.\"

You don't move. This man is clearly not a father. 
"
autowrap_mode = 3
metadata/SetAsOverrideLabel = ""
metadata/ShowOnVar = ""
metadata/HideOnVar = ""

